      <title>白月光下线，平替组团杀疯了：OpenRouter Fusion API 让多模型“开会”平替 Fable 5</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openrouter-fusion-api-fable-5-20260615214007185-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 21:40:07 +0800</pubDate>
